 processed_at: timestamptz" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="infra_tb_inbox_14"><mxGeometry y="74" width="380" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="infra_t_18" value="&lt;b&gt;Luồng&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;1. Service ghi dữ liệu nghiệp vụ + 1 dòng outbox trong CÙNG transaction.&lt;br/&gt;2. Outbox relay (poll mỗi giây, FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED) publish lên RabbitMQ, đánh dấu published.&lt;br/&gt;3. Consumer nhận message → INSERT inbox(message_id, consumer) → trùng thì bỏ qua → xử lý trong cùng transaction." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;rounded=1;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="520" width="900" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
